  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, salt, pepper, and baking powder.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together milk, eggs, and melted butter.",
    "Add the dry ingredients to the wet ingredients and stir until just combined.",
    "Heat a large non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the Irish bacon and cook until crispy, flipping halfway through.",
    "Transfer the cooked bacon to a paper towel-lined plate.",
    "Pour the batter into the skillet and cook until the edges start to set.",
    "Add the mushrooms to the skillet and cook until they release their moisture.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 15-20 minutes.",
    "Serve the fluffy eggs with crispy bacon, mushrooms, and mixed peel."
  ],
